A||N||17||Voytek||*sob* Got Rear-ended Today  *sob*||||9||
Z||000000||Voytek||09-25-2001||05:48 PM||||I'll just whine for a moment and then I'll shut up.<P>I was on my way to work.  At 7:59 AM, about 3 blocks away from where I work (I was going to be on time for once), the traffic came to a stop - someone was turning.  So I look in the rear view mirror and there is this GrandAm that I raced (and beat) on the highway 2 minutes earlier.  He did look like he was catching up pretty fast.  2 seconds later - wham!  'MY BABY IS HURT' I thought (actually, I swore).<P>When all was said and done, I ended up with about $1200 worth of damage (according to the adjustor).<P>AND, get this: the insurance claim person (lady) says this: 'Oh, it's a Fiero? Then you better file a police report - it'll most likely have quite a bit of damage'.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> ?????!!!!!  Yeah, OK.  The GrandAm actually looked worse.<P>Just had to share my story.<BR>I think it's time for a whole new paint job.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||9
Z||000001||Jake_Dragon||09-25-2001||05:54 PM||||Time for a V8  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>How's your neck?||||reg||1
Z||000002||Voytek||09-25-2001||06:13 PM||||Mighty, mighty sore!  I think it'll require extensive recovery and lotsa compensation (you know, sleepless nights, lost income - the usual.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> )||||reg||1
