Z||000004||rogergarrison||09-25-2001||06:21 PM||||maybe he thought you were both still racing, and he was pulling a 'Gordon' on ya. Id see what kind of offer there gonna do. If its OK, take it and go. If not, go for neck backaches, screw em for every cent you can get.||||reg||1
Z||000005||Rick 88||09-25-2001||06:22 PM||||Voytek,<P>Sorry to hear about the wreck. I'm glad to hear you are ok and your Fiero repairable. I guess that blows my theory on yellow Fiero's being safer due to their color. Was the person that hit you on the phone? I am considering installing strobing brake lights if they are legal. Anyone know about this?<P>Rick<BR>yellow 88 GT 5-speed||||reg||9
Z||000006||Voytek||09-25-2001||06:36 PM||||Rick88 - no, the guy wasn't on the phone.  There was a PT Cruiser between us.  Just as it pulled into a gas station, the guy in the GA hammered the gas and there I was.<P>Fierowrecker - I know what you mean.  The adjustor said that I avoided a 'write-off' narrowly.  If I had a broken taillight or anything else, the car would be toast.  Phew!||||reg||1
Z||000007||FLASHY||09-25-2001||06:46 PM||||So what's gonna happen for Red Deer? I'm doubting it'll be fixed by then. That sucks man! (mainly about your car...but the Red Deer run too). Glad you're OK.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/cool.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/flash_sig.gif"> <P>"I know you believe you understand what you think I wrote, but I'm not sure you realize that what you read is not what I really meant"||||reg||1
Z||000008||RiceCooker||09-25-2001||07:32 PM||||Oh man, I'm so sorry to hear that<P>I would've liked to see how scared he was when you got out of your car with a pi$$ed off look on your face. (Hopefully a roll of toilet paper was in order for him)<BR>I think I would have liked to see you to $1200 damage to his face!<BR>I would ask for pics but i would honestly cry at the sight.<P>here's to getting well soon...<P>Todd<P><BR>||||reg||1
